WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.760
Russian President Vladimir Putin is know for his bizarre photos ops.

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:12.523
In the West these seems crazy. They're the type of things we turn into Internet memes

00:00:12.523 --> 00:00:22.343
They make great animated gifs. There are entire Tumblrs dedicated to "Shirtless Putin Doin' Things"

00:00:22.343 --> 00:00:26.571
Action figures showing him riding bears and doing other crazy things.

00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:36.179
But where we in the West see this as the crazy antics of an ego maniac

00:00:36.759 --> 00:00:41.159
In Russia they actually have a very important political purpose.

00:00:41.159 --> 00:00:47.299
"That's an image that looks like it should be airbrushed onto the side of a van in New Jersey rest area."

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:56.740
So, in Russia, Putin's image is crafted to make him seem like a figure that is both powerful and lovable

00:01:00.996 --> 00:01:07.996
So that is what it says when Putin is interacting with Animals or children. But also is very careful in these photos

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.980
To stage them so that he's powerful: He's riding the horse, surveying the land around him.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:21.320
Often they show him as if he's stepped into someone else's profession for a day and had incredible success.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.020
On one occasion he appeared as a dentist.

00:01:30.836 --> 00:01:36.516
He's famously had a photo op in the Black Sea where he was shown emerging from the water

00:01:36.516 --> 00:01:40.936
carrying two ancient Greek amphorae which are these incredible archeological finds.

00:01:40.936 --> 00:01:46.082
And the initial story is that he had just happened to be swimming and discovered them.

00:01:46.082 --> 00:01:51.962
But it quickly came out that they had been planted there for him to discover.

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:58.667
So the message from all of these is that he is this incredibly impressive individual.

00:01:58.864 --> 00:02:03.424
But it also has a more simple and direct message which is:

00:02:07.956 --> 00:02:13.556
The truth is that power in Russia is centralized with Putin to an incredible degree.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:20.720
There no clear successor in place. It's not clear at all what the government would look like without him.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:26.220
And that makes it pretty scary for people to contemplate what would happen if Putin were to become seriously ill.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:30.333
They also reassure Russians that Putin is healthy and strong.

00:02:32.249 --> 00:02:36.249
He is trying to live up to this Russian ideal of the "real man"

00:02:36.249 --> 00:02:40.451
the person who is strong and impressive and macho and powerful.

00:02:40.451 --> 00:02:44.947
A lot of these photos are also designed to show impressive Russia is.

00:02:44.947 --> 00:02:51.867
When he's hunting that a reminder of its wealth of wildlife and natural resoures.

00:02:53.929 --> 00:02:59.689
No one is as popular as Putin. No one is as recognizable. No one as that populist appeal.

00:03:00.078 --> 00:03:07.038
And when he shows that he has these high levels of popularity, that's how he shows the elites, "I got this"

00:03:07.038 --> 00:03:08.623
You  don't need to worry that the country is going to slip from my grasp.

00:03:08.623 --> 00:03:13.583
And it's also a way of reminding them that there is no one else but Putin.

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:20.803
There is no other figure in Russia that has the same level of bother popular support and elite support.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:29.600
(Putin singing)

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:33.520
These photos might seem weird and crazy to us

00:03:34.395 --> 00:03:41.395
But they also tell us a lot about Putin's strategy about where he stands both with the Russian public and with Russian elites.

